      "id": "sol.amc-8-1987-p3.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The ten evenly spaced numbers have average \\(90,\\) so their sum is \\(10 \\times 90 = 900.\\)\n\nDoubling gives \\(2 \\times 900 = 1800.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is E .",
      "hints": [
        "The ten numbers \\(81,\\) \\(83,\\) \\(\\ldots,\\) \\(99\\) are evenly spaced",
        "Their average is \\(\\dfrac{81 + 99}{2} = 90,\\) so their sum is \\(10 \\times 90\\)"
      ],
